note runs AL with stdout and stderr to region 29's file; region 3 gets the output without trailing newlines
fn shafield r ulong to void
for i ulong get Bn 3
c = get B add mul ulong 3 4096 i
if eq c 32
break
end
bc r c
end
bt r TNL
end

note env.txt: the commit, the binaries, the driver, the kernel, the pin and the bar. git and sha256sum are in 19/31.
fn envtxt to void
